  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jwqbqlS.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"2250\" height=\"375\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nerfashton/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Nerfashton</a> 為此材質包提供的靈感</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0iEjhu6.png\" width=\"1384\" height=\"77\"></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>此材質包適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-cursor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursors Extended</a> 模組，將您的游標替換為《Ben 10》主題風格。<br><br>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alienevo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution</a> 搭配使用效果更佳。</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/omnicraft-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q4zmTA0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"271\" height=\"192\"></a>收錄於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/omnicraft-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Omnicraft: Ben 10</a><br><br></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0iEjhu6.png\" width=\"1384\" height=\"77\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fBen10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1221978/description_20a86c04-33c2-4156-a305-bc230da764bc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><br><br></h3>",
